{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國一名資深警探因涉嫌在刑事調查過程中不當使用微軟Copilot人工智能助手而受到獨立調查。事件再次引發外界對於人工智能在執法領域應用邊界以及敏感數據安全問題的關注。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583608.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:24:54.654633+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:16:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.670116+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.670116+00:00","content_hash":"a3f5570ea8412921046b8d54b0b044b402bffbeb6181d00b08b9417f2f3f9118","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}